<#ff6ec8>ZAMASU</>
Zamasu Jousting		^X / _F^X
  Dashing stab and slam.
Zamasu Back Stab		_B^X
  Appears behind the opponent and knocks them
  toward Black.
Zamasu Comet		_D^X
  Tracking dive kick, launches.
Zamasu Blaster		_U^X
  Two fireballs angled down.
  Usable mid-combo. Needs a full Zamasu bar (bottom of the
  screen, refills in about 7 seconds).

<#ff6ec8>SANCTIFIED BLOOD</>
Sanctified Blood (install)		^B_+^C
  Powers up the next En Garde, Omen or Noose (not EX):
  En Garde throws them through a portal (launcher),
  Omen's spikes carry them to the wall, Noose sends a
  ground wave. Used up by that special.

<#ff6ec8>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves
  him open.
Grab		^Y
Reverse Grab		_B^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second
  cooldown.
Ki Charge (hold)		^A_+^B
Dash / Back Dash		_F_F / _B_B
Air Dash		_F_F / _B_B (air)
Super Jump		_D_U
Double Jump		_U (air)

<#ff6ec8>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Hop Kick		_F^B / _B^B
Tornado Kick		_DF^B
Twin Kick		_F^C, ^C
Launcher		_D^C
Sweep		_DF^C
Passion Kick (while running)		^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C

<#ff6ec8>SPECIALS</>
  C is the strongest version. EX = two attacks, half a bar.
Omen		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
  EX: slow multi-hit energy wave.
En Garde		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
  EX: stabs through a portal behind the opponent.
Noose		_D_D^A / ^B / ^C
  A: lands back, B: mid-screen, C: crosses up.
  Hold the button to keep twirling.
  EX: teleport execution grab.

<#ff6ec8>SUPERS</>
Blade Storm (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Dark Omen (1 bar, air)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
  Hold Up / Down to steer the ball.
Punishment (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  With another bar: two attacks during the rush for
  Zamasu's hold and a Kamehameha.
Holy Severance (2 bars)		_F_DF_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  A+B: clones come at once, B+C: latest.
  Any two of A / B / C.
Divine Cross (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  Also hits downed opponents (OTG).
  The ender depends on Black's life: Divine Punishment
  (LV1) above 50%, Grotesque Wrath (LV2) at 50% or
  less, Infinity Corruption (LV3) at 25% or less.
